+Hole and whole-body straight-extrusion candidates are opt-in: explicitly add
+`hole` or `extrusion` to `feature_kinds`; the default remains the legacy three
+categories. Hole geometry reports its form (`through_hole`, `blind_hole`,
+`stepped_hole`, `counterbore`, or `countersink`), axis, entry/exit/bottom face
+references, ordered diameters and depths, total depth, and analytic wall
