∩盘底，+Z 凸台方向；盘底/盘顶/凸台顶 = z=0/10/30。\n2. 策略：block-and-feature 体素路线（FTC geometry tier #3）——圆柱基体 + 圆柱 union + 圆柱孔刀 ×2 + QL 选边 fillet ×2，一个 feature 一个块。\n3. S1：盘+凸台+中心孔 → 轴对称阶梯回转体；验体积/bbox/QL 卡片。\n4. S2：+6×⌀11@PCD78 + 根部 R3 + 外缘 R2×2 → 6 孔最终形态；验孔卡片/torus 卡片/选边卡。\n5. S3（预留）：USER 改参轮（8 孔 + PCD 88 守卫判定）→ 可行 PCD 交付 + 回归 + 渲染 + 隔离评审。\n6. Role 5：scadpkg + STEP + STL + 4 渲染图 + 重开校验。"}]},{"i":6,"ts":"2026-09-05 20:29:30","role":"roleswitch","roleName":"Verifier Planner","reading":"examples/flange_plate/REQUIREMENTS.md, examples/flange_plate/BUILD_PLAN.md, docs/skill/references/discipline/geometric-validation.md, docs/skill/references/docs/guides/ql-selection-playbook.md","artifact":"examples/flange_plate/verify/s1_hypothesis.py, examples/flange_plate/verify/s1_verify.py","blocks":[]},{"i":7,"ts":"2026-09-05 20:33:20","role":"asst","model":"glm-5.3","curRole":"Verifier Planner","blocks":[{"t":"think","md":"Role 3 S1：先定义验收，再让 Role 4 动源码。S1 输出=轴对称阶梯回转体（盘∪凸台−中心孔）。判据：体积解析比对（π/4·(od²·t+boss_od²·(top−t)−bore²·top)）、bbox、三张 QL 面卡片（凸台顶环面/孔壁圆柱面/盘底环面）、守卫 known-bad 四连。探针先行：手搭体素复刻体证明每条测量能区分对错。注意凸台顶面被 ⌀30 中心孔穿透——第一版探针把它当整圆算错了期望值，实测 1668.971 = π(27.5²−15²) 揭穿了这一点：这是检查的算术错，不是几何错，修探针不修几何。"},{"t":"tool","name":"read","status":"ok","input":"{\"file_path\": \"/Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/docs/skill/references/discipline/geometric-validation.md\"}","output":"# Discipline: Geometric Validation — 每 boolean 后gate相关项；QL 选边三默认（shared_boundary > tag > 几何窗+卡片）；fillet 前选边卡（数量+边长）+.exactly(n)；只报告跑过的检查。 (164 行)"},{"t":"tool","name":"read","status":"ok","input":"{\"file_path\": \"/Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/docs/skill/references/docs/guides/ql-selection-playbook.md\"}","output":"# QL Selection Playbook — 卡先于基数：resolve 打印卡片→读→.exactly(n)；坐标用区间不用等值；boolean 后单一属性不充分（面积+中心窗）；shared_boundary 失败签名表。 (177 行)"},{"t":"tool","name":"write","status":"ok","input":"{\"file_path\": \"/Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/flange_plate/verify/s1_hypothesis.py\"}","output":null},{"t":"patch","hash":