0] z[0.00,30.00] boss_top n=1\nS2 verifier: ALL PASS"},{"t":"text","md":"修复闭环：faces=17（预期值）、8 孔壁全在（r=42.25，相位 0..315@45°）、体积回到支架内（rel 0.00021）。守卫判定链完整入证据：88 → G2a 拒（web 0.5\u003c2）；85 → G2b 拒（web==R_edge 相切，实证退化）；84.5 → 全守卫过（web 2.25，裕度 0.25）。8 孔版几何回归全过。S1 契约的阶段锁定语义记录在 BUILD_PLAN（D5 承担最终形态上的 S1 不变量）。"}]},{"i":21,"ts":"2026-09-05 20:44:50","role":"asst","model":"glm-5.3","curRole":"Detail Modeling Planner & Builder — S3","blocks":[{"t":"think","md":"Role 4 S3 渲染证据：render_screenshot_rpath 显式 view=(elev,azim) 出单视图。首版输出路径算错（落到仓库根 out/，应为 examples/out/）——修路径重渲，删错目录。目检只确认非空白（产图上下文不得自证），判定权交隔离 reviewer。本 host 没有 task/subagent 工具，用独立视觉模型（analyze_image MCP，全新上下文，只喂渲染图 URL + REQUIREMENTS 形状描述）当干净评审员，每视图一次独立调用——满足\"图像判定由隔离 reviewer 出具\"的门槛，机制差异如实记录。"},{"t":"tool","name":"write","status":"ok","input":"{\"file_path\": \"/Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/flange_plate/render_views.py\"}","output":null},{"t":"patch","hash":"71e379e01b","files":["examples/flange_plate/render_views.py"]},{"t":"tool","name":"edit","status":"ok","input":"{\"file_path\": \"/Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/flange_plate/render_views.py\", \"summary\": \"OUT 路径 parents[2]→parents[1]，输出到 examples/out/flange_plate/\"}","output":null},{"t":"patch","hash":"cb001b11b2","files":["examples/flange_plate/render_views.py"]},{"t":"tool","name":"bash","status":"ok","input":"{\"command\": \"cd examples/flange_plate && uv run python render_views.py && ls ../out/flange_plate/\"}","output":"rendered /Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/out/flange_plate/render_iso.png\nrendered /Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/out/flange_plate/render_front.png\nrendered /Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/out/flange_plate/render_top.png\nrendered /Users/lildino/Project/ocws/SCAD-Open/examples/out/flange_plate/render_detail.png\nrender_detail.png  render_front.png  render_iso.png  render_top.png"},{"t":"tool","name":"task","status":"ok","input":"{\"subagent\": \"isolated-vision-r